        "file": "app.ts",
        "line": 2,
        "message": "This adapter hides read or write from SQL analysis (conditional selection). Call the executor on the SQL text (`read(sql) or write(sql) or (flag ? read : write)(sql)`). `run(read, account) or run(write, account)` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
